# RoyalRushNpc (31921), a Four Sepulchers manager, against the local clock (the clock line pins it
# to 00:49:57 on the driven clock, which the advance steps move). Created, it places the five
# lock NPCs its lock_* parameters name as its privates, at the sepulcher doors since lock_x1 is
# 0. It reads the clock every second: at minute 50 it shouts that the entry closes (ShoutMsg 1),
# at minute 55 the two closing lines; in the first 30 s of minute 54 it frees the sepulcher
# (AVQuest0, not observable here).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/royal_rush_npc.golden
clock 00:49:57
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.RoyalRushNpc
npc lock1 31925 Folk 5000 0 0
npc lock2 31926 Folk 5000 0 0
npc lock3 31927 Folk 5000 0 0
npc lock4 31928 Folk 5000 0 0
npc lock5 31929 Folk 5000 0 0
npc manager 31921 Folk 100 0 0 ai lock_npc_id1=31925,lock_npc_id2=31926,lock_npc_id3=31927,lock_npc_id4=31928,lock_npc_id5=31929,ShoutMsg=1

advance 2s
  live 31925 2
advance 1s
  S NpcSay obj=manager type=1 npc=1031921 text="Game over. The teleport will appear momentarily."
advance 5m
  S NpcSay obj=manager type=1 npc=1031921 text="You may now enter the Sepulcher."
  S NpcSay obj=manager type=1 npc=1031921 text="If you place your hand on the stone statue in front of each sepulcher, you will be able to enter."
advance 5m
advance 5m
  S NpcSay obj=manager type=1 npc=1031921 text="Currently5minutes, have passed"
